        "date": "2026-01-08T09:24:35Z"
      },
      "message": "Reference Model: Add imp_stall_buffer to indicate IOPMP has stall buffer\n\nFrom the application note of the IOPMP specification, IOPMP can\noptionally implement a buffer to record and store all stalled\ntransactions during the IOPMP programming process. This commit adds new\n\"imp_stall_buffer\" configuration to indicate that IOPMP implements this\nbuffer. The \"imp_stall_buffer\" depends on \"stall_en\" feature. The\nexisting \"stall_cntr\" is incremented only when \"imp_stall_buffer\" is\ntrue.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "649d7f49d791bf614be795e69982f39220944042",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/riscv-non-isa/riscv-iopmp/git/trees/649d7f49d791bf614be795e69982f39220944042"
      },
